On Sat, 28 Feb 2004 07:36:50 +0000, Mark Healey wrote:

> I'm chaotic in minetown.  Sometimes the guards have stuff I want.  Can
> I kill them with impunity?  What about peaceful monsters?

Killing peaceful monsters--which includes guards, shopkeepers, and the
priest--will still lose you alignment, but not anger your god. You can
make up pretty easily through sacrifice but that's going to be difficult
if the altar's not already chaotic. Unless and until you convert the
altar, it's just tactically a bad idea.

And don't forget that the first killing will bring all the guards upon you
in a swarm. If you want to make it work, then you have to somehow
immobilize the victims one by one, or farm the job out to a pet like
usual. Unless you really *want* to leave a bones file....  

